-- title:
--   Integral closure in an étale Kummer algebra K[X]/(Xⁿ-u)
-- statement:
--   Let $A$ be an integrally closed commutative domain and $K$ a field equipped with an $A$-algebra structure making it a field of fractions of $A$. Let $n$ be a natural number and $u \in A$, and assume that the image of $n$ in $A$ is a unit and that $u$ is a unit of $A$. Consider the polynomial $X^n - u$ over $K$, where $u$ is taken in $K$ along the structure map, and the $K$-algebra $L = K[X]/(X^n - u)$ obtained from it by `AdjoinRoot`, with $\alpha \in L$ the class of $X$ (the element `AdjoinRoot.root`); $L$ is regarded as an $A$-algebra through $A \to K \to L$. The assertion is an equality of $A$-subalgebras of $L$: the integral closure of $A$ in $L$, that is the subalgebra of all elements of $L$ integral over $A$, coincides with the $A$-subalgebra $A[\alpha]$ generated by the single element $\alpha$. No assumption is made that $X^n - u$ is irreducible, so $L$ need not be a field; it is a finite product of finite separable extensions of $K$ (and is the zero ring when $n = 0$ and $u \neq 1$ in $K$).
--
--   This is the affine computation of the normalisation of an integrally closed base in a Kummer algebra $X^n = u$ in the unramified case: when $n$ and $u$ are invertible, the obvious order $A[\alpha]$ is already integrally closed. It is used, after the substitution $X \mapsto hX$ that turns $X^n - v h^n$ into $X^n - v$, in [`IsIntegrallyClosed.integralClosure_eq_adjoin_and_etale_and_finite_of_eq_mul_pow`](thm.html#IsIntegrallyClosed.integralClosure_eq_adjoin_and_etale_and_finite_of_eq_mul_pow), where the same conclusion is combined with the étaleness and module-finiteness of $A[X]/(X^n-u)$ over $A$ supplied by [`AdjoinRoot.etale_and_finite_X_pow_sub_C_of_isUnit`](thm.html#AdjoinRoot.etale_and_finite_X_pow_sub_C_of_isUnit).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_IsIntegrallyClosed_integralClosure_eq_adjoin_root_X_pow_sub_C_of_isUnit.lean

import Mathlib

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
